{"script":"yd_012_04","exps":[{"para":{"tag":"tag_1"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"layer":"chara2"},"key":"top"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"setLayer"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":1,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]我看你最近好像带了很多猎物回来啊。有好好地注意狩猎上的细节吗？[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_3"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1c","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]不、不，这也谈不上什么赐教。不过，我倒是可以分享一下自己的经验。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_4"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1b","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]我认为，捕猎的目的是为了让自己过上更好的生活。[r]若只顾着追捕猎物而不考虑捕猎后的事情，会浪费很多本来应得的资源。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_9"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]若是带回来的猎物千疮百孔，也很难分解成可利用的资源，拿到市场上也卖不了多少钱吧。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_10"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1a","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]要是你同意，我很乐意和你分享这些高效又实用的技巧。[r]毕竟受了你这么多照顾，你也是我难得的猎友。[l][cm]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_5"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"img":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","layer":"chara2"},"key":"setLayerFace"},{"para":{"nameSide":"left","charaName":"沃夫加","text":"[show]找个时间我亲自示范给你看吧，又或者现在就可以？[l][cm][hide]"},"key":"text"},{"para":{"tag":"tag_8"},"key":"tag"},{"para":{"noIn":false,"mirrow":false,"alpha":0,"scaleX":1,"addImg":"chara012_1_face_chara012_1d","layer":"chara2","noOut":false,"x":277.5,"transTime":300,"scaleY":1,"trans":true,"bright":1,"y":-419,"img":"chara012_1"},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":300},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"end":true},"key":"end"}],"des":"沃夫加-熟识1"}